{
  "$schema": "https://glama.ai/mcp/schemas/server.json",
  "maintainers": [
    "dreamforgestudiollc"
  ],
  "description": "EMET 0.3.0 is an MCP memory server: persistent shared memory, verified writes, per-client attribution and approvals, and client-side GEM execution. EMET verifies the record, not the computation. A GEM is seated only when its released flag is true. Free and open source under the MIT License; no account, key or payment required to run it.",
